I have the jbofihe data.  It has everything we need to automatically
generate short versions of all the gismu places, and IMO all the
stuff we need for the full gismu stuff as well.

http://packages.debian.org/source/squeeze/jbofihe -- the relevant
files are extradict places.dat patterns, and "man smujajgau"
explains the format, if you have it installed.

I'll see about coming up with complete data files shortly.

